-ml/jax/issues/5605","minimized":null,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc3MjY1NzIzNQ==","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":2,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":2,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/772657235/reactions"},"updated_at":"2021-02-03T16:52:11Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/772657235","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/348932?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hawkinsp","id":348932,"login":"hawkinsp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODkzMg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"I just pushed jaxlib 0.1.60, which fixes this issue. Hope that helps!","created_at":"2021-02-04T01:45:19Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/5605#issuecomment-772961249","id":772961249,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/5605","minimized":null,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc3Mjk2MTI0OQ==","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/772961249/reactions"},"updated_at":"2021-02-04T01:45:19Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/772961249","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/348932?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hawkinsp","id":348932,"login":"hawkinsp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODkzMg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/348932?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hawkinsp","id":348932,"login":"hawkinsp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODkzMg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/348932?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hawkinsp","id":348932,"login":"hawkinsp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODkzMg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"NONE","body":"I noticed a substantial memory leak when calling this function repeatedly and casting the outputs to `float`:\r\n\r\n```python\r\n@jax.jit\r\ndef loss(weights, observations, actions, rewards):\r\n        \"\"\"Actor-critic loss.\"\"\"\r\n        logits, values = network(weights, observations)\r\n        values = jnp.append(values, jnp.sum(rewards))\r\n\r\n        td_errors = rlax.td_lambda(\r\n            v_tm1=values[:-1],\r\n            r_t=rewards,\r\n            discount_t=jnp.full_like(rewards, discount),\r\n            v_t=values[1:],\r\n            lambda_=jnp.array(td_lambda),\r\n        )\r\n        critic_loss = jnp.mean(td_errors ** 2)\r\n\r\n        if type_ == \"a2c\":\r\n            actor_loss = rlax.policy_gradient_loss(\r\n                logits_t=logits,\r\n                a_t=actions,\r\n                adv_t=td_errors,\r\n                w_t=jnp.ones(td_errors.shape[0]),\r\n            )\r\n        elif type_ == \"supervised\":\r\n            mask = jnp.isfinite(logits)\r\n            logprob = jax.nn.log_softmax(jnp.where(mask, logits, -1e5))\r\n            labels = jax.nn.one_hot(actions, logits.shape[-1])\r\n            actor_loss = -jnp.sum(labels * mask * logprob) / labels.shape[0]\r\n\r\n        entropy_loss = jnp.mean(entropy_loss_fn(logits, jnp.ones(logits.shape[0])))\r\n        return actor_loss, critic_loss, entropy_cost * entropy_loss\r\n\r\n# watch memory usage climb\r\nwhile True:\r\n    loss_components = loss(weights, observations, actions, rewards)\r\n    loss_components = [float(x) for x in loss_components]\r\n```\r\n\r\nI also noticed the following:\r\n\r\n```python\r\n>>> type(loss_components[0])\r\n<class 'jaxlib.xla_extension.Buffer'>\r\n```\r\n\r\nI would have expected something like `DeviceArray` here.\r\n\r\nThe following does not leak:\r\n\r\n```python\r\nwhile True:\r\n    loss_components = loss(weights, observations, actions, rewards)\r\n    loss_components = [float(np.asarray(x)) for x in loss_components]\r\n```\r\n\r\n--- \r\n\r\nDo you have any intuition what might be going on? If this is a `haiku` or `rlax` issue I'm happy to re-raise there. If you don't know what's going on here let me know and I will create a smaller reproducer.","closed_at":"2021-02-04T01:45:19Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/348932?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hawkinsp","id":348932,"login":"hawkinsp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODkzMg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/st